    {
      "op": "dm_intro",
      "title": "The Scout Camp",
      "subtitle": "Campaign 1: The Lantern Road  -  Level 1  -  4 Emberfall 1047 AK",
      "text": "Deep in Thornpike Woods, on the trail of whoever stole the core of Lantern Thirty-Seven, four tired strangers have just fought off a pack of starving wolves. Ilsevel's new familiar, the owl Pell, flies ahead in the dark. Brannoc leads, Oriel watches the rear, and Tamsin, as usual, is thinking of something she probably should not do."
    },
    {
      "op": "music",
      "track": "dark_forest",
      "fade_in": 1.0,
      "volume": 0.45
    },
    {
      "op": "location_card",
      "text": "Thornpike Woods  -  Firelight  -  Night",
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "op": "narrate",
      "text": "East of the birches the trail dips, and between the pines there is firelight. Goblin voices, arguing about something."
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Three voices. A fire. They're not expecting anyone.",
      "speaker": "brannoc"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "I should say, before anyone is brave, that I have nothing left but cantrips. And I am bleeding. A little.",
      "speaker": "ilsevel"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "I've used every prayer I had tonight. Until I sleep, I've only the small ones.",
      "speaker": "oriel"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Then we wait for dawn.",
      "speaker": "brannoc"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "By dawn that cart's gone, Big Man. Wherever it's going.",
      "speaker": "tamsin"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Rusk told us what goblins like to hear. Stones, a boss, supper. Let me walk in there and tell them a story.",
      "speaker": "tamsin"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Alone.",
      "speaker": "brannoc"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Alone's the only way anyone believes a story. You lot creep up to the bushes and look large.",
      "speaker": "tamsin"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "And if it goes wrong?",
      "speaker": "oriel",
      "emote": "question"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Then come and save me. Heroically. I'll scream, so you know when.",
      "speaker": "tamsin",
      "emote": "smile"
    },
    {
      "op": "narrate",
      "text": "They go in through the undergrowth, one careful step at a time."
    },
