    },
    {
      "op": "narrate",
      "text": "The lie is so cheerful, and so sure of itself, that the goblins simply swallow it. Two of them even step away from their knives."
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Tonight? Cart goes at dawn. Always dawn. Boss counts every stone, he does.",
      "speaker": "goblin-1"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "And now he wants them early. Lovely fire, by the way.",
      "speaker": "tamsin"
    },
    {
      "op": "narrate",
      "text": "Behind the goblins, a grey shield rises slowly out of the bushes."
    },
